  "description": "The Genesis CDA 20 takes everything that makes the CDA so versatile and refines it for riders who want to go further. With upgraded components and a wider gear range than the CDA 10, it's the premium option in the CDA line ‐ ideal for long-distance commuters and gravel explorers who demand more performance from their machine.\n\nBuilt around the same lightweight 6061 aluminium frame and chromoly fork, the CDA 20 adds a smoother-shifting 2X drivetrain for a more responsive ride over varied terrain. The geometry remains relaxed and confidence-inspiring, while the improved gearing makes light work of hills and maximises on-road speed.\n\nWide tyre clearance, disc brakes, and full mounting points retain the CDA's trademark versatility, letting riders switch easily between commuting setups, bikepacking loads, or sleek weekend builds. The CDA 20's refined specification keeps it efficient on the road yet tough enough for unpaved adventure ‐ the perfect upgrade for riders ready to push further.",
